Package: cgltf
Type: Package
Title: Header-Only Library for Loading 'glTF' Models
Version: 1.15.0-1
Authors@R: c(
    person("Tyler", "Morgan-Wall", email = "tylermw@gmail.com",
        role = c("aut", "cre"),
        comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-3131-3814")),
    person("Johannes", "Kuhlmann", role = c("aut", "cph"),
        comment = "Author of the bundled cgltf library"))
Description: Provides the header-only 'cgltf' 'C' library for reading
    'glTF' (Graphics Library Transmission Format) 3D models and their binary
    'GLB' representation <https://github.com/jkuhlmann/cgltf>.
    Supports scene hierarchies, mesh data, materials, skins, morph targets,
    and animation channels.
